gin-left:2em;\"><b>ftypes </b> = <code style=\"text-indent:0em;\">FieldType||list||dict||None</code>. <span style=\"color:#48566B;\"> Default None</span>. </p><p style=\"margin-left:4em;\">The field types of the Layer. It can be:</p><p style=\"margin-left:6em;\">1) A FieldType object.</p><p style=\"margin-left:6em;\">2) A list of FieldType objects.</p><p style=\"margin-left:6em;\">3) A dict of field name and field type.</p><p style=\"margin-left:4em;\">If data is a Layer, ftypes can not be set.</p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\"><b>crs </b> = <code style=\"text-indent:0em;\">str||int||class||None</code>. <span style=\"color:#48566B;\"> Default None</span>. </p><p style=\"margin-left:4em;\">The coordinate system of the Layer. Can be EPSG, WKT, Proj4, and other types of coordinate characters. If data is a Layer, crs can not be set.</p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\"><b>**kwargs</b>: </p><p style=\"margin-left:4em;\">Other parameters passed to _algos.geodatabase.GeoDatabase.</p><h2 id=\"method\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#method\"><span>Method</span></a></h2><h3 id=\"add-feature-features\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#add-feature-features\"><span>add_feature<span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#8a90a8;font-size:88%;\">(*features)</span></span></a></h3><p>Add features to Layer.</p><p style=\"font-size:120%;color:#9298ED;font-weight:bold;\">Parameters:</p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\"><b>*feature</b>: <code style=\"text-indent:0em;\">Feature</code>. </p><p style=\"margin-left:4em;\">One or more vector features.</p><h3 id=\"add-field-name-none-dtype-unknown\" tabindex=\"-1\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#add-field-name-none-dtype-unknown\"><span>add_field<span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#8a90a8;font-size:88%;\">(name = None, dtype = &quot;UNKNOWN&quot;)</span></span></a></h3><p>Add a field to Layer.</p><p style=\"font-size:120%;color:#9298ED;font-weight:bold;\">Optional:</p><p style